{"steam_appid":1983620,"steam_name":"Infinitevania","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1983620/1431671262/793c34217b2e42cff9711bebb50aae3c85bd000b/1784604257/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784604703","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257365100/609f0fa8c60b7e93512fe75780e3b62756b0bff5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784604703","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/445277239a700a5cd6da854b757f0391db7fa5a8/ss_445277239a700a5cd6da854b757f0391db7fa5a8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786462436","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/e5e3d26c33825a5d55d9be5b6d3b05b74f736bb0/ss_e5e3d26c33825a5d55d9be5b6d3b05b74f736bb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786462436","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/c02eb27ec0dabeb4774b753415e1a5ade79ff548/ss_c02eb27ec0dabeb4774b753415e1a5ade79ff548.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786462436","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/1efd042a57cacc45d019008fd36f2dc8dea83aeb/ss_1efd042a57cacc45d019008fd36f2dc8dea83aeb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786462436","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/2fbe6b9acbfd14b7920c8384666331233fc5d90c/ss_2fbe6b9acbfd14b7920c8384666331233fc5d90c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786462436"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested, be sure to Wishlist the game - that helps a lot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/9e150fcade8af4c6593bea47cb17073a.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=300 /></span>Infinitevania is a 2D platformer in the metroidvania style, heavily inspired by Castlevania: Symphony of the Night and featuring elements from Hollow Knight. The game focuses on combat, exploration, puzzles, upgrades, and an breathtaking story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Explore different worlds</strong></i></u> <br>Defeat the most powerful creatures in these worlds, absorb their powers, and grow stronger to destroy the core of Infinitevania and return to your own world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/4fe70215ab237d8a5d89508bb6775110.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/4fe70215ab237d8a5d89508bb6775110.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/4fe70215ab237d8a5d89508bb6775110.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/9d1e492fe48965e0dad970fb318cf162.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Face challenging enemies</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop unique strategies to overcome them, adapting to each battle as you progress on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/8bc23ef335d0174bb92bf660b97756ea.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/8bc23ef335d0174bb92bf660b97756ea.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/8bc23ef335d0174bb92bf660b97756ea.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/6184c61209c71be5033caf5b90a97a0a.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/6184c61209c71be5033caf5b90a97a0a.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/6184c61209c71be5033caf5b90a97a0a.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/95c3e027f2733df274f631d056de3613.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Solve puzzles</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle intriguing enigmas to unlock new areas and hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/ef64c8fd493cfbaba292f1eccf08da9e.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/ef64c8fd493cfbaba292f1eccf08da9e.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/ef64c8fd493cfbaba292f1eccf08da9e.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/5539655cceda6f71f8c30a53f3e40beb.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Survive deadly traps</strong></i></u> <br>Navigate treacherous environments that test your skills and reflexes at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/796e1f60c8ef1bdbcda6468580fdb478.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/796e1f60c8ef1bdbcda6468580fdb478.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/796e1f60c8ef1bdbcda6468580fdb478.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/8b4e6f2061f18a58cc0a69ba3964c97f.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Collect Upgrades to Become Stronger</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your abilities and equipment throughout your adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/007735d562704315ce74657fa419dbbd.poster.avif?t=1786462436\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/007735d562704315ce74657fa419dbbd.webm?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983620/extras/007735d562704315ce74657fa419dbbd.mp4?t=1786462436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-3240, AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 560 Ti (1GB), Radeon HD 7750 (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 650 or Radeon HD 5770<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["JHT Games"],"publishers":["JHT Games"],"release_date":"Jul 24, 2026"}